# Per-package statement-coverage floors for `make cover`.
#
# Floors are set just below the measured value so they catch a real
# regression without failing on a one-line refactor. Raise a floor when a
# package improves; lower one only with a comment explaining why.
#
# `skip` is for packages that are deliberately not part of the production
# surface (test-only helpers, fixtures, tooling).
ALL                82
cmd/bacnet-shield  67
internal/access    91
internal/bacnet    81
internal/bacnet/sc 96
internal/config    93
internal/observ    85
internal/proxy     77
internal/safego    100
internal/scnet      88
internal/watchdog  90
internal/testkit   skip
scripts/covercheck skip
